cedar-tetra3rs-db

tetra3rs_db.bin is a star pattern database generated by make-tetra3rs-db
(cedar-server, tetra3rs branch of https://github.com/trams/cedar-server) from
gaia_merged.bin, the merged star catalog published by the tetra3rs project:

  https://github.com/ssmichael1/tetra3rs
  https://storage.googleapis.com/tetra3rs-testvecs/gaia_merged.bin

That catalog is derived from:

  Gaia Data Release 3 -- European Space Agency (ESA) mission Gaia,
  processed by the Gaia Data Processing and Analysis Consortium (DPAC).
  Gaia data are made available under the Creative Commons
  Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 IGO licence (CC BY-SA 3.0 IGO).
  https://www.cosmos.esa.int/web/gaia-users/license

  Hipparcos, the New Reduction (Hipparcos-2), F. van Leeuwen, 2007,
  A&A 474, 653.

This database is therefore distributed under CC BY-SA 3.0 IGO, with the
attribution above.
